```"},{"name":"mcp__codex_apps__codex_document_control_get_document_tool_schemas","description":"Use Codex Document Control to find connected document sessions, inspect the tools supported by a selected session, and execute one supported tool against that session. Call `list_document_sessions` first to choose the intended connected session, call `get_document_tool_schemas` before constructing tool arguments, then call `execute_document_command` with a caller-stable `idempotency_key`. Use this only for connected Codex document control; do not use it for general spreadsheet, presentation, or document tasks without a connected document session.

